flowchart LR
  Source[设备与文件] --> Batch[M03 批次 校验 去重]
  Batch --> Reject[隔离与质量记录]
  Batch --> SourceEvent[(稳定源事件与批次行结果)]
  SourceEvent --> Capture[(采集主表与类型扩展)]
  Batch --> Counter[(设备状态与真实采集计数)]
  Capture --> Search[M05 检索]
  Search --> Context[M06 AnalysisContext]
  Context --> Map[M07 地图轨迹]
  Context --> Task[M08 M09 分析任务]
  Capture --> Rule[M10 规则匹配]
  Rule --> Alert[(告警事件)]
  Alert --> Delivery[通知与回执]
  Capture --> Refresh[批次与水位增量汇总]
  Counter --> Refresh
  Refresh --> Snapshot[(统一指标定义与桶快照)]
  Snapshot --> Home[M04 M13 首页]
